{"file": "乡下来的掌上明珠-第141集.mp4", "ep": 141, "duration": 45.2, "segments": [{"start": 5.36, "end": 6.36, "text": "无恙这孩子"}, {"start": 6.36, "end": 8.36, "text": "胃口怎么突然这么好"}, {"start": 8.36, "end": 10.36, "text": "准备八菜一汤"}, {"start": 10.36, "end": 13.54, "text": "八个菜"}, {"start": 13.54, "end": 14.54, "text": "总够吃了吧"}, {"start": 14.54, "end": 18.23, "text": "门我是悠悠"}, {"start": 18.23, "end": 20.54, "text": "漂亮哥哥"}, {"start": 20.54, "end": 21.54, "text": "你别生气"}, {"start": 21.54, "end": 23.54, "text": "生气就不漂亮啦"}, {"start": 23.54, "end": 27.02, "text": "哥 给你吃"}, {"start": 27.02, "end": 30.04, "text": "你 你摘的"}, {"start": 30.04, "end": 32.0, "text": "悠悠可厉害啦"}, {"start": 32.0, "end": 34.0, "text": "虽然是刘奶奶抱着我"}, {"start": 34.0, "end": 35.0, "text": "但是是我自己"}, {"start": 35.0, "end": 37.58, "text": "从树枝上摘下来的哦"}, {"start": 37.58, "end": 38.58, "text": "甜"}, {"start": 38.58, "end": 40.58, "text": "你 你要拉臭臭吗"}, {"start": 40.58, "end": 41.58, "text": "进来了"}, {"start": 41.58, "end": 43.58, "text": "哥哥 有虫臭"}, {"start": 43.58, "end": 44.58, "text": "哪里"}, {"start": 44.58, "end": 45.58, "text": "你嘴里"}]}